<title>USA: Vencor extends expiration of tender offer.</title>
<headline>Vencor extends expiration of tender offer.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vencor Inc said on Wednesday it had extended the expiration date of its $16.00 per share cash tender offer to acquire Transitional Hospitals Corp midnight EDT on June 10.</p>
<p>Approximately 10,677,214 shares of Transitional's common stock have been validly tendered and not withdrawn pursuant to the tender offer, Vencor said.</p>
<p>The tender offer was scheduled to expire at midnight June 4, Vencor said.</p>
